%% Sequence 3: stuck and escape. Built with stubs (T011, T012, T009, T018, T021 in PR #10). The real detector, scripted escape and fallback are spec 005 (PR #12).
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant D as stuck_detector (stub, trigger service)
  participant S as supervisor (built)
  participant C as coverage_server
  participant E as escape_server (stub built)
  participant M as twist_mux
  participant G as stop_guard
  participant O as operator

  Note over S: submode COVERING, cover_room goal active
  D->>S: /myRobot/stuck StuckEvent (stamp, pose, scan_ranges planned 005-R04)
  S->>C: cancel cover_room goal (001-R07)
  S-->>S: submode ESCAPING within 0.5 s, remember COVERING, start escape_timeout_s 20 s
  alt escape server not yet discovered (PR 10)
    S-->>S: retry from the tick up to escape_server_wait_s 2 s, clock not extended
  end
  S->>E: action /myRobot/escape goal (event, timeout_s)
  E->>M: /myRobot/mux/escape Twist reverse then turn (priority 80 beats coverage 50)
  E-->>S: result success (strategy scripted, later rl in spec 008)
  S-->>S: back to the previous submode COVERING (001-R08)
  S->>C: cover_room goal again with the same room_id (resume planned, 005-R32)
  alt escape fails or exceeds escape_timeout_s
    E-->>S: result success false, or timeout
    S-->>S: submode ESCAPE_FAILED
    S->>G: /myRobot/mux/lock_stop true
    G->>M: /myRobot/mux/stop zero Twist at 10 Hz (priority 250)
    M-->>M: /myRobot/cmd_vel exactly zero (001-R10)
    S-->>O: Notification ERROR ESCAPE_FAILED on /myRobot/notifications
    O->>S: service /myRobot/supervisor/reset (Trigger)
    S->>G: lock_stop false
  end
